  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-20T05:07:37.436Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are so many worlds I used to love going to that now have quest support and it makes things a lot more complex having to always check if someone is quest to tell whether they can see my avatar or not. I have no intention on making quest versions of my avatars nor do I want to have to stay in PC only worlds. I miss going to some of those old worlds and want to continue hanging out in them. I want an option that will simply \"hide\" all quest users from me, and me from them. It won't count as a block in the trust ranks or anything, just simply removing them from my experience and myself from theirs.",
